abstract: "Scripts, configuration, graph-construction records, and per-seed results that reproduce every table in the paper: pre-training relation profiling, split audits, five edge-only controls, the three-component decomposition of graph gains, repeated-split variants, and the inductive deployment evaluation on five public encrypted-traffic benchmarks."
